Specifically, it assigns a dock identifier to the `shipment.dock` property.

Mutation Details

In `src/dispatch/validation.ts`, the function calculates and assigns the dock value at the very end of its execution:

```typescript

const numeric = order.id

.split("")

.reduce((sum, character) => sum + character.charCodeAt(0), 0);

shipment.dock = order.type === "hazardous" ? "D4" : docks[numeric % 3];

```

